msgid "Soothify Africa — Find Your Inner Calm"
msgstr "Soothify Africa — Find Your Peace of Mind"

msgid ""
"Soothify Africa is building a simpler way to find balance, right here at "
"home. Therapy, guided meditation, Pilates and wellness content in Pidgin and"
" English. Join the waitlist for early access."
msgstr ""
"Soothify Africa dey build simple way to help you find balance, right here "
"for house. Therapy, guided meditation, Pilates and wellness content for "
"Pidgin and English. Join the waitlist make you get early access."

msgid "Primary"
msgstr "Main"

msgid "Soothify Africa — home"
msgstr "Soothify Africa — home"

msgid "Change Language"
msgstr "Change Language"

msgid "Login"
msgstr "Login"

msgid "Join Waitlist"
msgstr "Join Waitlist"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Soothify! Your space to breathe, reset, and take care of yourself"
" is on the way."
msgstr ""
"Welcome to Soothify! Your own space to breathe, reset, and take care of "
"yourself dey come."

msgid "Join waitlist"
msgstr "Join waitlist"

msgid "Life moves fast"
msgstr "Life dey move fast"

msgid ""
"We are building a simpler way to find balance, right here at home. Join the "
"waitlist to get early access when we launch"
msgstr ""
"We dey build simple way to help you find balance, right here for house. Join"
" the waitlist make you get quick access when we launch"

msgid "Person listening to calming music"
msgstr "Person wey dey listen to calm music"

msgid "Relaxation Music"
msgstr "Relaxation Music"

msgid "Soft, grounding sounds to help quiet a loud day"
msgstr "Soft music wey dey calm body to help quiet loud day."

msgid "Guided Pilates and stretching session"
msgstr "Guided Pilates and stretch session"

msgid "Virtual Pilates & Stretch"
msgstr "Virtual Pilates & Stretch"

msgid ""
"Low-impact movement and guided Pilates sessions to build core strength and "
"shake off physical tension"
msgstr ""
"Body movement and pilates sessions to build strength and comot body pain."

msgid "Woman in an online therapy session"
msgstr "Woman wey dey do online therapy session"

msgid "One-on-One Therapy Sessions"
msgstr "One-on-One Therapy Sessions"

msgid ""
"Safe, confidential spaces to talk through things with licensed professionals"
" who actually get it"
msgstr ""
"Private space to yarn with better professionals wey understand your matter "
"well well."

msgid "Person meditating"
msgstr "Person wey dey meditate"

msgid "Guided Meditation"
msgstr "Guided Meditation"

msgid "Simple, bite-sized practices to help you catch your breath"
msgstr "Small meditation practice to help you rest your mind."

msgid "Reading a wellness article"
msgstr "Person wey dey read wellness article"

msgid "Wellness Articles"
msgstr "Wellness Articles"

msgid "Real, straightforward reads on rest, mental health, and everyday ease."
msgstr ""
"Straight to the point articles about rest, mental health, and how to enjoy "
"life easy."

msgid "Why Join early?"
msgstr "Why you suppose Join early?"

msgid "Pidgin & English"
msgstr "Pidgin & English"

msgid ""
"We want everyone to feel included. Switch seamlessly between Pidgin and "
"English so you can connect in the language that feels most natural to you."
msgstr ""
"We want make everybody fit belong. Make dem fit change between Pidgin and "
"English, so you fit yarn for the language wey sweet you pass."

msgid "Made for Our Reality"
msgstr "Made for Our Reality"

msgid ""
"We understand the unique rhythm of life here. Our content and support fit "
"your actual culture and lifestyle."
msgstr ""
"We know how life dey operate for here. Na him make we make sure say wetin we"
" carry come go fit everybody lifestyle."

msgid "Accessible & Affordable"
msgstr "Accessible & Affordable"

msgid ""
"Well-being shouldn’t feel out of reach. We’re keeping things realistic and "
"inclusive for everyone."
msgstr ""
"Body wellness no suppose cost die. We make am affordable and open for "
"everybody."

msgid "Find your people"
msgstr "Find your people"

msgid ""
"You won’t be doing this alone. Once we open our doors, you’ll join a "
"community of everyday people looking for a bit more peace and balance."
msgstr ""
"You no dey do this alone. Once we open our doors, you go join a community of"
" everyday people wey dey look for more peace, balance, and better way to "
"feel."

msgid "Join the Waitlist"
msgstr "Join the Waitlist"

msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr "Questions wey people dem ask pass"

msgid "Is Soothify live right now?"
msgstr "Soothify dey live right now?"

msgid ""
"Not yet! We are currently building and polishing the MVP to make sure it "
"feels just right. Joining the waitlist means you'll be the absolute first to"
" know the moment we open access."
msgstr ""
"Not yet! We still dey build and polish the MVP to make sure say everything "
"feel just right. If you join the waitlist, na you go be number one person "
"wey go know when we open door."

msgid "What do I get by joining the waitlist?"
msgstr "Wetin I go get if I join the waitlist?"

msgid ""
"Early access ahead of the public launch, plus first word on new features and"
" launch offers as they land."
msgstr ""
"Early access before the public launch, plus na you go first hear about new "
"features and launch offers as dem land."

msgid "Will therapy and content really be available in Pidgin?"
msgstr "Therapy and content really go dey available for Pidgin?"

msgid ""
"Yes. Pidgin and English are both first-class from day one, so you can switch"
" to whichever language feels most natural to you."
msgstr ""
"Yes. Pidgin and English both dey from day one, so you fit change to any "
"language wey sweet you pass."

msgid "Are therapy sessions truly confidential?"
msgstr "Therapy sessions really dey confidential?"

msgid ""
"Always. Sessions are private between you and your licensed professional, and"
" your data stays protected."
msgstr ""
"Always. Sessions dey private between you and your licensed professional, and"
" your data dey protected."

msgid "Follow Us"
msgstr "Follow Us"

msgid "Soothify Africa on Facebook"
msgstr "Soothify Africa for Facebook"

msgid "Soothify Africa on Twitter"
msgstr "Soothify Africa for Twitter"

msgid "Soothify Africa on Instagram"
msgstr "Soothify Africa for Instagram"

msgid "Soothify Africa on LinkedIn"
msgstr "Soothify Africa for LinkedIn"

msgid "Take charge of your well-being. Don't let stress run the show"
msgstr "Take Charge of Your Well-being. No let stress control your life"

msgid ""
"We're putting the final touches on everything. Drop your email to claim your"
" spot on the waitlist"
msgstr ""
"We dey put the final touches to everything. Drop your email make you secure "
"your spot for the waitlist."

